# The room's brain for the server: the shared Haxe simulation and
# shunt.online.RaceRoom, as one CommonJS file the TypeScript requires.
# Build: haxe build.hxml   (from this folder; npm run build does it too)

-cp ../sim/src
-D js-es=6
-dce full
-js lib/race-room.cjs
shunt.online.RaceRoom
shunt.online.Messages
shunt.online.OnlineTuning
